@ismaelsadeeq Thanks for the clarification. 
I applied your proposed simplification, using `post_load_mempool_weight` and `retention_ratio` to make clear that this is a permissive heuristic rather than an exact measurement of restored snapshot weight. 
I’ve also added you as a co-author.

